<span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you for taking the time to complete the Qantas post-flight survey.&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif">We were disappointed to read that your recent Qantas experience was not to our usual high standard and we would like to assure you that we have taken your feedback seriously and shared it with the relevant teams. Feedback is important to us as it allows us to determine the areas where we can make positive changes.</span></span><br />
<br />
